WEBVTT

00:06.140 --> 00:07.980
Does it look funny?

00:08.590 --> 00:09.950
It looks fine.

00:10.220 --> 00:11.450
You mean it?

00:11.450 --> 00:13.040
I mean it.

00:13.040 --> 00:14.810
Now hurry up before you're late.

00:14.810 --> 00:15.980
R-Right.

00:16.380 --> 00:18.160
I'm off, then!

00:18.160 --> 00:18.860
Okay.

00:29.860 --> 00:32.790
Nishimura-san!

00:34.570 --> 00:36.900
Oh, g-good morning.

00:37.320 --> 00:39.050
Yeah, good...

00:39.050 --> 00:40.630
Whoa!

00:40.630 --> 00:41.450
Huh?

00:41.930 --> 00:45.640
Y-Y-You look a little different today.

00:45.940 --> 00:47.970
Now you're Pigtailmura-san!

00:47.970 --> 00:50.050
Y-Yeah.

00:51.510 --> 00:53.710
You look cute like this!

00:54.370 --> 00:56.140
They're great!

01:02.250 --> 01:05.360
It's different than usual, 
but it looks really good.

01:06.350 --> 01:11.000
Yukiko-san thought they might suit me.

01:11.000 --> 01:12.580
I'm so jealous!

01:12.580 --> 01:15.760
I want a matching hairstyle with you, too!

01:15.760 --> 01:18.870
You gonna try and rock pigtails, Takada?

01:18.870 --> 01:20.460
Wait, what?

01:21.240 --> 01:23.150
How disgusting.

01:24.170 --> 01:27.870
That hairstyle doesn't fit you at all!

01:29.420 --> 01:32.760
Of course pigtails wouldn't fit him.
 It's Takada.

01:32.760 --> 01:34.180
I'm sorry...

01:34.180 --> 01:36.850
I didn't mean Takada!

01:37.150 --> 01:42.220
I meant that hairstyle is a terrible match
 for the Grim Reaper herself.

01:42.220 --> 01:43.180
What?!

01:43.180 --> 01:46.550
He said it's a terrible match for you!

01:46.550 --> 01:47.860
Y-Yeah.

01:47.860 --> 01:51.010
It's fine. I don't mind at all.

01:52.150 --> 01:54.030
That's amazing!

01:54.830 --> 01:57.830
Wh-What's so amazing about that?!

01:57.830 --> 01:59.690
What? It's freaking incredible.

02:00.070 --> 02:03.590
You said this hairstyle is a terrible
 match for the Grim Reaper,

02:03.590 --> 02:05.530
but look at how good she looks in it.

02:06.500 --> 02:08.520
It really is incredible.

02:08.520 --> 02:12.500
That's just proof of what a cutie you are!

02:12.810 --> 02:16.220
I had a feeling that might be it!

02:17.470 --> 02:20.390
<i>I'm glad I gave them a shot!</i>

02:25.310 --> 02:29.290
<i>Today is September 1st,
the beginning of a new semester.</i>

03:55.830 --> 04:00.010
My <b>Clueless</b> First Friend

04:01.050 --> 04:06.430
<i>Episode 6 "Changing Desks, Class Reps, and New Friends"</i>

04:09.840 --> 04:11.410
What?!

04:11.410 --> 04:15.410
Does this mean your seat 
is next to mine, Nishimura-san?!

04:19.630 --> 04:20.970
The pleasure's all mine.

04:20.970 --> 04:23.500
I'm already feeling lucky this semester!

04:24.530 --> 04:27.400
To celebrate, you can have 
this sticker I really like!

04:29.380 --> 04:30.770
<i>How cute...</i>

04:32.340 --> 04:33.770
Thanks.

04:33.770 --> 04:36.710
Just ask anytime if you want more!

04:38.250 --> 04:40.840
<i>Just knowing Takada-kun 
will be sitting next to me</i>

04:40.840 --> 04:44.010
<i>is enough to make school 
feel fun. I wonder why.</i>

04:44.310 --> 04:46.890
Just knowing you're sitting next to me

04:46.890 --> 04:49.460
makes school feel way more fun.

04:49.460 --> 04:50.860
I wonder why.

04:52.060 --> 04:55.510
I don't think I can pay 
attention in class now!

04:55.510 --> 04:57.280
I'm way too stoked.

04:59.320 --> 05:00.110
Huh?

05:00.530 --> 05:02.970
What's wrong, Nishimura-san?

05:02.970 --> 05:04.700
Nishimura-san?

05:05.380 --> 05:08.030
<i>We were thinking the same thing!</i>

05:08.460 --> 05:11.560
It's not fair you guys get to sit so close.

05:11.560 --> 05:13.740
Ah, Hino-kun.

05:13.740 --> 05:16.370
I wished for it in a dream, and it worked!

05:16.370 --> 05:19.800
The one night that I didn't 
have any dreams...

05:17.880 --> 05:22.460
<i>I didn't get to play with Takada-kun 
even once during summer vacation...</i>

05:22.840 --> 05:24.180
What's wrong?

05:24.180 --> 05:26.260
Nothing. Don't worry about it.

05:29.470 --> 05:29.850
Class Reps

05:29.470 --> 05:38.600
Two students

05:30.210 --> 05:32.140
And so...

05:32.140 --> 05:36.450
Does anyone want to be a
 class representative for this semester?

05:36.450 --> 05:38.600
I'm not letting you go until we decide!

05:38.600 --> 05:40.230
What?!

05:40.230 --> 05:41.780
Why not?!

05:41.780 --> 05:43.710
No way!

05:44.410 --> 05:46.480
Wow, class reps?

05:47.240 --> 05:49.830
They get to rule the class.

05:50.900 --> 05:52.560
Y-Yeah...

05:52.940 --> 05:54.450
Sensei!

05:54.450 --> 05:57.500
Nishimura-san looks like she wants to do it!

05:57.500 --> 05:57.750
What?

05:58.110 --> 05:58.700
Huh?

05:58.700 --> 05:59.410
Really?!

06:01.420 --> 06:06.010
Nishimura-san has good grades, 
so I think she'd be perfect.

06:02.090 --> 06:10.550
Class Reps

06:02.090 --> 06:10.550
Two
students

06:06.010 --> 06:07.340
There we have it.

06:07.790 --> 06:10.570
Well, Nishimura? Want to give it a shot?

06:11.140 --> 06:13.800
I-I, um...

06:14.560 --> 06:17.370
There's no way she'll turn it down.

06:17.370 --> 06:19.840
I know Kitagawa wants to 
go home, but still...

06:19.840 --> 06:21.970
I don't care who it is! Just decide!

06:21.970 --> 06:24.830
W-Well...

06:25.430 --> 06:26.760
Does that sound good?

06:26.760 --> 06:28.110
S-Sure—

06:28.110 --> 06:29.020
Sensei!

06:31.040 --> 06:34.000
In that case, I'll do it, too!

06:35.970 --> 06:37.300
Are you sure?

06:37.300 --> 06:39.490
Yeah! It sounds awesome!

06:39.770 --> 06:42.100
Okay, that settles it.

06:44.720 --> 06:46.360
You cool with this, Kasahara-san?

06:46.360 --> 06:49.260
If it keeps up, Nishimura-san's 
gonna steal Takada-kun.

06:49.260 --> 06:50.180
Wha?!

06:50.410 --> 06:51.990
Th-Th-That's not...

06:51.990 --> 06:54.000
I d-don't care about...

06:54.450 --> 06:56.430
Think about it.

06:56.430 --> 06:59.640
This is your chance 
to partner up with Takada-kun!

07:03.560 --> 07:06.370
Okay, the two of you will be 
our class representatives...

07:06.370 --> 07:07.360
Sensei!

07:07.360 --> 07:10.190
I want to be a class rep, too!

07:10.190 --> 07:11.360
<i>What?!</i>

07:11.360 --> 07:12.080
Huh?

07:12.080 --> 07:13.060
What's going on?

07:15.400 --> 07:20.170
We can only have two representatives, 
so you three talk it over and decide.

07:20.590 --> 07:22.830
No need to worry, Nishimura-san.

07:22.830 --> 07:26.290
Takada-kun and I will be the class reps!

07:26.730 --> 07:27.760
But...

07:29.930 --> 07:35.050
If I step down now, I'd be 
dumping the work on Takada-kun.

07:35.870 --> 07:39.010
<i>No plans to hand the partnership over, I see.</i>

07:39.010 --> 07:43.050
You should know that being class 
rep is surprisingly hard work.

07:43.380 --> 07:46.930
There's no way someone as 
dense as you could handle it.

07:47.250 --> 07:48.820
I'm sorry...

07:48.820 --> 07:51.150
No! I didn't mean you, Takada-kun!

07:51.380 --> 07:54.120
Just now, I was...

07:54.120 --> 07:55.650
talking to Nishimura-san!

07:55.650 --> 07:57.160
Huh? Really?

07:57.160 --> 08:02.050
But if Nishimura-san can't do it,
 there's no way I could.

08:02.050 --> 08:03.670
'Cause I'm dumb.

08:03.670 --> 08:05.740
How is <i>that</i> your conclusion?!

08:06.090 --> 08:08.300
We don't care who does it.

08:08.300 --> 08:09.640
Yeah, yeah!

08:09.640 --> 08:12.970
What about Nishimura and Kasahara, then?

08:14.250 --> 08:15.780
<i>Those jerks...</i>

08:16.300 --> 08:18.190
Oh, that's a good idea!

08:18.190 --> 08:19.350
Not happening!

08:19.350 --> 08:20.090
Huh?

08:21.600 --> 08:23.610
W-Well...

08:27.220 --> 08:30.310
A class rep needs a good reputation!

08:30.700 --> 08:32.550
Huh? Reputation?

08:32.550 --> 08:34.940
Y-Yes, reputation!

08:35.450 --> 08:38.250
In other words, popularity within our class!

08:38.250 --> 08:42.230
They're leaders, so of course 
everyone needs to like them!

08:43.030 --> 08:44.450
<i>Reputation...</i>

08:45.250 --> 08:50.930
The one with the worst reputation 
here is Nishimura-san.

08:50.930 --> 08:52.530
Hey now, Kasahara.

08:53.370 --> 08:55.000
You think so?

08:55.000 --> 08:55.570
Huh?

08:56.280 --> 09:01.170
I think Nishimura-san is 
the most popular one here.

09:01.570 --> 09:06.160
That's why Kitagawa-kun and the others 
wanted her to be class rep.

09:06.160 --> 09:07.140
What?!

09:07.560 --> 09:09.860
I-It's our fault?!

09:10.550 --> 09:13.320
Nishimura-san sure is amazing!

09:13.320 --> 09:14.520
What the heck?!

09:14.940 --> 09:17.070
It should obviously be me!

09:17.070 --> 09:21.030
I mean, Nishimura-san 
doesn't have any friends!

09:25.410 --> 09:27.380
Wait, really?

09:27.380 --> 09:30.920
That means I get her all to myself for now!

09:30.920 --> 09:32.920
Hooray!

09:33.870 --> 09:35.990
Oh, hang on, there's two of us.

09:35.990 --> 09:37.880
Hino-kun's her friend, as well!

09:37.880 --> 09:39.640
Snooze, snooze...

09:39.640 --> 09:43.980
<i>Aw, jeez! He's coming on so strong, 
right at the beginning of the term!</i>

09:43.980 --> 09:47.850
I want to hang out with you 
lots in the second semester,

09:47.850 --> 09:50.670
like we did over summer, 
and get to know you more and more!

09:52.170 --> 09:56.650
<i>I didn't get to invite Takada-kun 
anywhere during summer vacation!</i>

09:57.570 --> 09:59.920
Why are we talking about this again?

10:00.200 --> 10:01.040
What?!

10:01.810 --> 10:03.800
I-I get it already.

10:03.800 --> 10:06.920
You two can be our class reps.

10:06.920 --> 10:09.500
No, I'm fine letting you have it.

10:09.500 --> 10:10.780
What?!

10:10.780 --> 10:14.100
You think I'm too dense to do it, right?

10:14.100 --> 10:16.550
L-Like I said, that was...

10:16.550 --> 10:18.060
It's settled, then.

10:18.360 --> 10:22.550
Our class representatives for the second 
semester will be Nishimura and Kasahara.

10:23.820 --> 10:25.270
Let's get along.

10:25.270 --> 10:26.650
What?!

10:27.180 --> 10:30.650
<b>Summer Vacation Drills
</b>Japanese, Math, Science, Social Studies, English

10:33.650 --> 10:35.110
For crying out loud!

10:35.110 --> 10:37.350
How'd it end up this way?!

10:37.350 --> 10:39.330
You guys!

10:40.880 --> 10:42.470
We'll carry half of those.

10:42.470 --> 10:43.990
We're here to help.

10:43.990 --> 10:45.360
Thanks.

10:45.710 --> 10:47.480
<i>And he comes anyway!</i>

10:48.000 --> 10:53.000
My <b>Clueless</b> First Friend

10:56.160 --> 10:58.500
Did you watch that show last night?

10:58.500 --> 11:00.420
Yeah, I saw it.

11:00.690 --> 11:02.460
It was really good!

11:02.460 --> 11:05.260
That ending makes me 
curious about next week.

11:05.260 --> 11:05.960
Yeah.

11:05.960 --> 11:08.730
Seriously, what's gonna happen to those two?!

11:08.730 --> 11:11.130
You're talking about 
<i>Let's Go, Sleeve God</i>, right?

11:11.130 --> 11:13.350
Huh? Was that the title?

11:13.350 --> 11:15.430
You think they'll get torn off?

